    {
      "en": "label harukadate1:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe I’ll see what Haruka is up to?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now that I think about it, the two of us haven’t really hung out except for that one time she gave me a ride home.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And even then it was more along the lines of just...getting to her house and leaving a few minutes later.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Besides, she wouldn’t have given me her number if she didn’t want to actually talk, right?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not knowing what else to do, I tap on Haruka’s name in my phone and wait for her to answer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello?",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, it’s-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know who it is. I've had your name in my phone since I asked you to check on Rin for me.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And you haven't bothered calling? Do you even like me?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, you haven't called either!",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is everything okay, though? Is this about Rin again? Because she seemed fine earlier today and-",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everything is fine. I was just wondering what you were doing tonight.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tonight? I was going to hang out at Sara’s bar.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you...want to come or something?",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. If you guys are cool with having me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm sure we are, but let me check anyway! Hold on a sec.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A moment of silence passes by as Haruka does...whatever.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sara says you're free to come so long as you spend a lot of money.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What if I just come, spend a normal amount of money, and keep you company?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hmm...well, I do seem like the loneliest person at the bar...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re probably the only customer at the bar in general.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also correct. So, are you going to come over now, or?...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I’m on my way. Don't get too drunk without me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What's that? You want me to get super drunk without you? I mean...I wasn't going to but, if you insist-",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Haruka-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Byeeeeee~!",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, Haruka seems a bit...livelier than normal today.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I just hope that she doesn't actually wind up getting too drunk while I'm on my way over since dealing with her and Sara that way sounds...hard.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe I'll try walking a little faster than normal...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
