    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take a moment to straighten out my clothes before making my way inside.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm sure no one cares, but it is one of the exceedingly rare opportunities I have to be alone with people actually close to my age and I should at least look the part of a mature human being.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Even if my companions for the evening will see me as one giant blur...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukabar1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukabar1.webp",
      "alt": "harukabar1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heeeeey! You made it! I’m not alone anymore!",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
