      "en": ": I’ve been here with you the entire time...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, you two. What’s up?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take a seat next to Haruka, whose face has already gone full-blush from drinking.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sara is busy wiping down the counter in front of us and, surprisingly enough, doesn't seem drunk at all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which I guess means this will, at least for the time being, be a decently lopsided conversation in which we counteract...however Haruka is when she's drunk.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How was your walk, man? See anything cool along the way?",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe like a...huge stick or something?",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I immediately understand how Haruka is when she's drunk.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was a normal walk. I didn’t see anything particularly notable.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cool, cool. Normal walk. Got it.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Great icebreaker, Haru-chan.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukabar2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukabar2.webp",
      "alt": "harukabar2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...you two are friends? Or...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
