    {
      "en": "scene harukabar3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukabar3.webp",
      "alt": "harukabar3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I haven’t even had anything to drink yet...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, Haruka. I’ve seen Sara drunk and she-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shhhh...You and me are talking right now. She’s just a bartender. It’s my turn to have you.",
