    {
      "en": "But the truth is, I really don’t mind.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Would I have minded if she was a less horny drunk? Possibly. But this seems like a pretty great turn of events for me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Besides, Haruka works hard enough as-is. It’s probably nice for her to take a load off like this every once in a while.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I get a beer, Sara?",
