    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukabar8.webp",
      "alt": "harukabar8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cause it's a lot less fun drinking myself to sleep if I have to keep walking downstairs.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
